    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2 data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1022\">Level 3 — <strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1022\">Escalation</strong></h2><p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1047\">Your Burn feeds itself.</p><h3 data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1071\">Mechanical Effects</h3><p data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1112\">While you are at <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1111\">Burn 2–3 (Engaged)</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1220\"><li data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1154\"><p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1154\">Your weapon attacks deal <strong data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1154\">+tier damage</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1220\"><p data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1220\">Each hit that gains this bonus <strong data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1204\">adds +1 Burn</strong> (once per turn)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1264\">While you are at <strong data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1263\">Burn 4+ (Overheated)</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1449\"><li data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1331\"><p data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1331\">Your weapon attacks deal <strong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1317\">+tier additional damage</strong> (total +2×tier)</p></li><li data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1449\"><p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1449\">Each hit automatically forces a <strong data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1387\">Body check</strong> or the target is <strong data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1415\">shaken</strong> (roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on its next attack)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1462\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1462\">Risk</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1532\"><li data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1532\"><p data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1532\">Each missed attack at Burn 4+ allows the GM to trigger <strong data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1532\">backlash</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1599\">Escalation is not optional.<br data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1564\" />If you hit harder, you burn hotter.</p>",
